    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部乱斗-得分规则】</>\n玩家将根据投影在战场上的表现而累计得分：\n按照存活的排名，前三名投影依次获得<Assistant_Red>60,40,30</>分，\n每有其他投影阵亡，自身投影获得<Assistant_Red>3</>分，\n击杀其他投影获得<Assistant_Red>5</>分。\n玩家需投入<Assistant_Red>8</>名以上的投影以获得奖励。比赛结束后，总分优秀者与对应投影数据突出者将额外获得<Assistant_Property1>称号</>奖励。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗]|8}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部乱斗-玩法规则]|9}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club Brawl - Scoring Rules】</>\nPlayers will accumulate scores based on the performance of their projections on the battlefield:\nAccording to the survival ranking, the top three projections receive <Assistant_Red>60, 40, 30</> points respectively. \nFor every other projection that falls, your own projection gains <Assistant_Red>3</> points, \nand killing other projections grants <Assistant_Red>5</> points.\nPlayers must deploy at least <Assistant_Red>8</> projections to be eligible for rewards. After the match, those with excellent total scores and outstanding projection data will receive additional <Assistant_Property1>Title</> rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club Brawl]|8}, {SendAnswer:[Club Brawl-Gameplay Rules]|9}",
