    ["<Assistant_Title1>神话装备</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n\n1、获得神话织茧后，可接取任务【隐秘之拥】，解锁铸造神话武器的方法。\n\n2、可先使用织茧游丝打造红色（神话）品质武器【夜幕之颂】，待获取神话织茧后，再补充材料进行【隐秘之拥】的铸造。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Mythical Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Description: </>\n\n 1. After obtaining a Mythical Cocoon, you can accept the quest [Embrace of Concealment] to unlock the method for forging mythical weapons. \n\n 2. You can first use Cocoon Silk to craft a Red (Mythical) quality weapon [Ode to Nightfall], and once you obtain a Mythical Cocoon, supplement the materials to perform the [Embrace of Concealment] forging.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>探险工装\n铁轨延伸至远方，工具叮当作响，一场蒸汽与引擎声交织的铁道之旅自此展开。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Adventure Workwear \n The tracks extend into the distance, tools clink and clatter, and a journey of steam and engine sounds begins.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>暗夜丝绒\n仲夏夜仙境中，划过天空的不仅有精灵的双翼，还有纷飞的诗心。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Dark Night Velvet\nIn the Midsummer Night's fairyland, what streaks across the sky is not only the wings of fairies, but also the fluttering of poetic hearts.",
